// Namespaces of the library. Kept out of the headers so that reading a header means
// reading about a type, and nothing else.

/// @namespace OpenAnima
/// @brief Root of the library.
///
/// Holds the error taxonomy, which is the one thing every package raises and every
/// caller catches.

/// @namespace OpenAnima::Core
/// @brief The agent and the vocabulary of a conversation.
///
/// Messages, roles, the answer a provider returns, and the brain that keeps the
/// history and drives the exchange.

/// @namespace OpenAnima::Http
/// @brief The boundary with the network.
///
/// A provider depends on this interface and never on a client library, so the same
/// provider runs against a hosted API, a local server, or a stand-in written for a
/// test.

/// @namespace OpenAnima::Provider
/// @brief Inference backends and their settings.
///
/// One interface to implement, one configuration type to fill, and the REST
/// implementation for the chat-completions contract.
